#: ../ui.py:321
msgid ""
"Choose a backup.\n"
"This will delete autoinstall list.\n"
"Do you really want to continue?"
msgstr ""
"Elija una copia de seguridad.\n"
"Esto eliminará la lista de instalación automática.\n"
"¿Quieres continuar?"

#: ../ui.py:292
msgid ""
"Choose a backup.\n"
"This will reinstall all plugins from your backup.\n"
